{
 "note": "The official Limelight effect catalog. Every effect is a change to ONE dimension of light (amount, colour, place, rate). A named effect is a preset: a saved set of values over the four dimensions. Its dials are the creator's interface. The renderer needs no special case for any of them. Derived from the protocol response for raga-of-revenge. See effects.md and architecture.md for the design.",
 "schema_version": 2,
